# HP — Ghostty theme built from the HP brand palette
# Source: https://www.hp.com/us-en/hp-information/brandcentral/our-visual-identity.html
# Brand swatches are used verbatim where they have enough contrast on the
# dark background. HP has no green/yellow/cyan, so those (and a few
# lightened tints of the brand blue) are derived and marked "derived".

